==German==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|de|laufen|Feuer}}. Originally for the line of gunpowder used to explode something remotely, then figuratively used for any fire that propagates rapidly.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n||Lauffeuer}}

# [[wildfire]], rapidly-spreading [[fire]]
#: {{ux|de|wie ein '''Lauffeuer'''|inline=1|like '''wildfire'''}}

